    {
      "id": "beats",
      "title": "Beats",
      "beats": [
        {
          "notes": "Overview: Open with the core promise: every beat is an explicit state, driven forward and backward by one transition model.\n\n[Pause] Establish the baseline state. Point out that nothing runs imperatively on click — advancing targets the next state."
        },
        {
          "notes": "[Click] Highlight how MagicText diffs and moves retained words ('A scene', 'deterministic', 'state.') instead of cross-fading the whole sentence."
        },
        {
          "notes": "[Click] Watch the bottom-right shared badge appear — it previews the cross-slide Magic Move handoff into Slide 2."
        }
      ],
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "s1:eyebrow",
          "frame": { "x": 128, "y": 128, "w": 1664, "h": 44 },
          "text": { "value": "FOUNDATION / PROVISIONAL", "style": "eyebrow", "color": "muted" }
        },
        {
          "id": "s1:prose",
          "frame": { "x": 128, "y": 240, "w": 1664 },
          "text": {
            "value": "A scene begins with one deterministic state.",
            "style": "body",
            "color": "foreground",
            "morph": {}
          },
          "builds": [
            {
              "kind": "change",
              "beat": 1,
              "set": {
                "text": { "value": "A scene advances to a deterministic next state." }
              },
              "durationMs": 500,
              "curve": {
                "bezier": [0.2, 0, 0, 1]
              }
            },
            {
              "kind": "change",
              "beat": 2,
              "set": {
                "text": {
                  "value": "The same path is reversible without inventing a second navigation model."
                }
              },
              "durationMs": 500,
              "curve": {
                "bezier": [0.2, 0, 0, 1]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "foundation-shared-card",
          "frame": { "x": 1736, "y": 896, "w": 56, "h": 56 },
          "stack": {
            "surface": { "fill": "accent", "cornerRadius": 16 }
